The program emphasizes advanced ministry competencies, theological reflection, and Spirit-empowered leadership within Pentecostal–Charismatic ministry contexts.

## Program Learning Outcomes

Students completing this program will be able to:

- Demonstrate advanced competence in pastoral and ministry leadership.
- Integrate biblical theology with contemporary ministry practices.
- Develop Spirit-led strategies for church growth and discipleship.
- Evaluate complex challenges in pastoral and Christian ministry.
- Apply Pentecostal–Charismatic theology to practical ministry.
- Conduct applied research addressing ministry-related challenges.
- Demonstrate advanced spiritual leadership and ministerial integrity.
